[PrintTextModified Text:虽然看到诺亚的魔法，大家有点吃惊……<br>不过，这里神奇的事情太多了。|#0105Adv10_Noah001| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Flushed1

[PrintTextModified Text:大家也不害怕诺亚的魔法。<br>欸嘿嘿，好开心。|#0105Adv10_Noah002| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（哦……大家其实还<br>　挺关心诺亚的情况的）|#0105Adv10_Ema001|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:那就好。|#0105Adv10_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯。为了报答大家，诺亚要加油画完这幅画。<br>大家看到一定会喜欢。|#0105Adv10_Noah003| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

