[PrintTextModified Text:小艾你真是个好孩子。<br>你一直那么努力，真的很了不起。|#0105Adv10_Miria001| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:呃，怎、怎么突然夸我！？<br>我、我没有很了不起啦……！？|#0105Adv10_Ema005| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看到艾玛脸红的样子，米莉亚微微一笑。|#0105Adv10_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:大叔我心想，一定要帮你们顺利回家。<br>……可说实话，我自己倒有点不想回去。|#0105Adv10_Miria002| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（不想回去……？）|#0105Adv10_Ema006| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:可能是我不敢去面对现实……面对自己吧。|#0105Adv10_Miria003| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

