[PrintTextModified Text:诺亚、蕾雅、米莉亚和梅露露，<br>吾辈很喜欢和你们在一起的时光。|#0105Adv10_AnAn001| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:然而，吾辈却亲手毁了它。<br>吾辈总是，对幸福发现得太晚。|#0105Adv10_AnAn002| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:对不起，吾辈不该奢求幸福——|#0105Adv10_AnAn003| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

