@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:……樱羽艾玛，你人还真好。|#0105Adv10_Nanoka001| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:明白了。我的身后就交给你守护了。<br>但我希望你不要误会。这是交易。|#0105Adv10_Nanoka002| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:交易……？|#0105Adv10_Ema013| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我是在利用你。<br>所以要是发生什么意外你也要利用我。|#0105Adv10_Nanoka003| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:别说什么利用不利用的……|#0105Adv10_Ema014| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……|#0105Adv10_Nanoka004| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不等艾玛说完，奈叶香就快步走了起来。<br>艾玛追上了她。|#0105Adv10_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……说好了，<br>我会相信奈叶香到底。|#0105Adv10_Ema015| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:既然你相信我，肯把身后交给我来守护……<br>那我也会相信奈叶香。|#0105Adv10_Ema016| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你说的交易……就是这么回事对吧！|#0105Adv10_Ema017| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……呼。|#0105Adv10_Nanoka005| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:奈叶香轻轻地吐了一口气。|#0105Adv10_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:如果是跟你们一起的话……|#0105Adv10_Nanoka006| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

