[PrintTextModified Text:谢谢你艾玛亲。|#0105Adv10_Coco001| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我啊，其实不讨厌这里的生活。<br>虽然只有一点点吧，<br>但我感觉大家就像家人一样。|#0105Adv10_Coco002| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:所以艾玛亲，也许也是我的【推】呢。|#0105Adv10_Coco003| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你可别死啊。要遵守约定啊。|#0105Adv10_Coco004| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

