[PrintTextModified Text:……其实呢。<br>我并不讨厌你说的那些漂亮话。|#0105Adv10_Margo001| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:虽然一直努力不去相信……<br>但现在，我有点想试着相信你了。|#0105Adv10_Margo002| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:如果是你，<br>也许真的能够拯救我们。|#0105Adv10_Margo003| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我很感谢你，<br>让我做了一个美梦。|#0105Adv10_Margo004| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

