[PrintTextModified Text:那个……我是在给艾玛做礼物，<br>希望能让你开心起来。|#0105Adv10_Hanna001| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:因为艾玛你最近一直卧床，<br>我就想给你做些东西，当作是慰问品……|#0105Adv10_Hanna002| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜移开视线，<br>有些不好意思地说道。|#0105Adv10_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:礼物……？|#0105Adv10_Ema022| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:不用大惊小怪的啦！？<br>不是什么很了不起的东西！|#0105Adv10_Hanna003| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

