[PrintTextModified Text:我们是真正的朋友啊。|#0105Adv10_Sherry002| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:永远都是好朋友！|#0105Adv10_Sherry003| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

