[PrintTextModified Text:"（我也不想忘记<br>　雪莉）|#0105Adv10_Ema024|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（啊，但是，我已经——）|#0105Adv10_Ema025| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:无论如何伸出手，都无法触及。|#0105Adv10_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛怀着抓住救命稻草般的心情，<br>触碰钢笔。|#0105Adv10_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

