[PrintTextModified Text:"（希罗……希罗，希罗……<br>　我不想忘记希罗）|#0105Adv10_Ema026|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（说起来，希罗的魔法<br>　是什么来着……）|#0105Adv10_Ema027|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@SpawnBlur ActorId:Stills-Forefront Intensity:1 FadeDuration:2

[PrintTextModified Text:——最终，一切都悄然消散，归于虚无。|#0105Adv10_Narrative020| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideActors ActorIds:Stills-Forefront Duration:1.5 Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛内心涌动着无法遏制的杀意。<br>这时，风声中传来了一阵低语。|#0105Adv10_Narrative021| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@Wait WaitMode:2

; 立ち絵・話者名の表示なし

[PrintTextModified Text:——我在这个世界上，<br>花了很长很长的时间，把诅咒散播出去。|#0105Adv10_Yuki001| AuthorId:Unknown RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——所以，很多人都拥有<br>【魔女因子】。|#0105Adv10_Yuki002| AuthorId:Unknown RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——真的很多、很多。|#0105Adv10_Yuki003| AuthorId:Unknown RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——我之所以授予艾玛特殊的魔法，正是为此。|#0105Adv10_Yuki004| AuthorId:Unknown RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——我想看到拥有纯洁心灵和美丽笑容的你，<br>屠杀很多很多人的场面。|#0105Adv10_Yuki005| AuthorId:Unknown RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——那样才更有趣不是吗？|#0105Adv10_Yuki006| AuthorId:Unknown RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——来，尽情屠杀吧，艾玛。|#0105Adv10_Yuki007| AuthorId:Unknown RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

